            "block_content": "Any paid personal leave not taken by December 31 $ ^{st} $ will be forfeited by the employee to the Employee Illness Leave Bank (E.I.L.B). Personal leave days for regular part-time employees will be granted on a pro-rata basis. Personal leave may be available in units of one-half hour and may be used in conjunction with vacation leave.",
